  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "This Gu is like a disk. Its surface is rough like an embryo made of grass and soil. In the middle of the disk is a ferocious beast with the head of a horse, tusks of an elephant, body of a turtle and the tail of a snake.",
        "chapters": [
          378
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After Fang Yuan finishes the yin and yang cloud step with beast phantoms, one Gu remains in the air. It is rank five and shaped like a disk with a rough surface like an embryo of grass and soil, and a ferocious beast in the middle with a horse’s head, elephant tusks, a turtle’s body, and a snake’s tail. The Second Aperture Gu recipe already names that product beast strength placenta, and the finished Gu is beast strength placenta Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          378
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "rcp_second_aperture_gu_recipe"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": []
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Absorbed apertures feed the Gu. After receiving nutrients it grows a little again. Its concrete surface has a thin layer of luster, and the surface is smoother, like poorly made porcelain.",
        "chapters": [
          380
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "surface-changes-with-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu has become smooth and clear, like a beautiful porcelain.",
        "chapters": [
          382
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "surface-changes-with-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "With aptitude near ninety percent, the Gu shines like a gem. Compared to its previous rough muddy shape, the difference is like night and day.",
        "chapters": [
          387
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "surface-changes-with-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan reaches this Gu after five days and five nights of multitasking work with land spirit aid, yin and yang clouds, elixir fire, golden sand, and four beast phantoms that must show their true natures before lightning fuses the mist. Fang Yuan reads the recipe as the work of an ancient strength path Gu Immortal, the original owner of the blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          378
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-at-san-cha-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After more refinement days past that eighty-nine percent stage, Fang Yuan holds a grey stone-like false Gu shaped like a beetle with a large belly and pointed ends. Ba Gui says he has succeeded in refining this false Gu and needs one more step to turn false into real Second Aperture Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          389
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "after-more-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
