  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Inside the San Cha Mountain blessed land hall, Fang Yuan asks land spirit Ba Gui for the full Second Aperture Gu recipe, and Ba Gui answers with that recipe’s full content in a long verse of close to ten thousand words. Refining Second Aperture Gu involves up to a thousand steps. Ba Gui also says large amounts of materials and Gu worms for that refinement are already stored in the hall.",
        "chapters": [
          378
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_ba_gui",
          "gu_second_aperture_gu",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan activates it around a dead Gu Master’s stomach, the shrinking aperture is sucked out, lands in the placenta, and is devoured by the wild beast inside. Absorbing that aperture makes the rough and coarse Gu become lustrous and shiny. The original embryo looked like it was made of soil and had crevices on the surface. After feeding it is thick and tightly packed, like a concrete brick.",
        "chapters": [
          379
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "after-tie-mu-bai",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Better and more numerous absorbed apertures raise the aptitude of the Second Aperture Gu that will be refined later. After Tie Mu Bai’s aperture alone, Fang Yuan judges that aptitude already at forty percent.",
        "chapters": [
          379
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "after-tie-mu-bai",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_mu_bai"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The blessed land’s original owner designed this Gu to plunder other people’s apertures as a demonic path method tied to that ancient strength path Gu Immortal’s plan.",
        "chapters": [
          379
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "after-tie-mu-bai",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "path_strength"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan defeats Long Qing Tian but does not kill him. Knowing he cannot survive, Long Qing Tian suicides with jade sky Gu poison. Fang Yuan has spent his last immortal essence portion on that fight and cannot safely take the poisoned aperture, so he judges that the beast strength placenta Gu’s aptitude can only reach eighty-nine percent.",
        "chapters": [
          388
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "poisoned-aperture-loss",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_long_qing_tian",
          "gu_jade_sky_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After rebirth Fang Yuan again uses beast strength placenta Gu to devour apertures, including Wang Xiao’s and Yun Luo Tian’s, and tracks the Gu’s aptitude climbing again, for example to eighty-three percent after those two.",
        "chapters": [
          400
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "after-rebirth",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_wang_xiao",
          "char_yun_luo_tian"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
